#* {{quote-book|fr|year=2011|title=France, état critique|passage=Probablement '''y a-t-il''' beaucoup plus de Français qu'on ne l'imagine prêts à entendre et à accepter un tel discours de vérité.|t=There are probably many more French than one imagines ready to listen to and to accept such a speech of truth.}}

====Usage notes====
* Used perhaps most often in interrogative clauses, but may also be used in declarative clauses after a modal adverb (see examples and quotations).

